{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-16T04:07:33.061Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"7ba3d75f240c935b707fc14c","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"probe"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1456","lineage:pm-gh1456","lineage:pm-n7rr","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"pm-gh1456","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1456","lineage:pm-gh1456","lineage:pm-n7rr","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"## Observed (pm 2026.10.15)\n\n```console\n$ pm list --status open --limit 2 --sort priority --format json | jq -c '.items[0]|keys'\n[\"id\",\"status\",\"title\",\"type\"]\n```\n\nThe result is ordered by `priority`, but the brief projection (`id,status,type,title`) leaves the sort key out. The ordering is visible but the value behind it isn't. An agent that asked for priority order and reads `.priority` gets `null` for every row. Then it either re-runs with `--fields id,priority,...` or misreports priorities. That happened in this session: a backlog survey printed `pnull` for every item.\n\nThe same applies to `--sort updated_at` / `created_at` / `deadline`.\n\n## Proposal\n\nWhen `--sort <field>` is given and `--fields` is not, add the sort field to the brief projection. In TOON that is one extra column. Record it in `projection.fields` so the omission receipt stays accurate. An explicit `--fields` stays authoritative."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-gh1481"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"GH-1481: Agent UX: pm list --sort <field> omits the sort key from the brief projection"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"GitHub report https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1481. An explicit list sort makes its sort key visible in the implicit brief projection, while explicit requested fields remain authoritative."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-ux","area:sdk","github-intake"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-10-16T04:07:33.061Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-16T04:07:33.061Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":120},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Explicit sort fields appear in implicit brief projection and projection.fields; Explicit --fields remains authoritative; SDK and CLI share the projection rule"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-5t33or"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"An explicit list sort makes its sort key visible in the implicit brief projection, while explicit requested fields remain authoritative."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Reporter reproduction retained in the body; implementation and installed-artifact acceptance remain pending."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-10-16T04:07:33.061Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Duplicate check 2026-10-16: strict complete all-status corpus of 2971 items with zero omissions plus request-specific keyword searches and live open/in_progress reads. No item references GH-1481. Existing foundational owners retain their prior completed scope; this child records the distinct newly reported defect. Kept open and unclaimed while finishing PR 1479."}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/escape_class","value":"production_defect"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"5dc51a74373d0b4b575fe98fb68e5497db3e19b357c197ec838d402145cd9a8c","item_hash_version":3,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"949c6af205a8cb48cb1071e4efb80b85e7386cbb0e1ccd87e0fda510a389472f"}
